{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_D5AE731D","title":"Second Thoughts","entry":"Dlg_D5AE731D::entry","exit":"Dlg_D5AE731D::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_CC57E4F4","articyId":"72057636987607605","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Nola Berg","text":"Well! If it isn't the salty server of simple dishes. What happened? You change your mind on my offer?","speakerId":"Ntt_4AEB60D1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Well! If it isn't the salty server of simple dishes. What happened? You change your mind on my offer?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":4,"name":"Shocked"},"position":{"x":212.6666717529297,"y":280.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"50795","byteOffset":33556496,"byteLength":448}},{"id":"DFr_448F8273","articyId":"72057636987607625","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Nola Berg","text":"Ah, well, I'm not really sure what I can do for you then. I'm in the business of aiding winners not abetting losers.","speakerId":"Ntt_4AEB60D1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Ah, well, I'm not really sure what I can do for you then. I'm in the business of aiding winners not abetting losers.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":800.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"38979","byteOffset":29077608,"byteLength":424}},{"id":"DFr_4B68E2E1","articyId":"72057636987607639","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Nola Berg","text":"What, you got Mo's mushrooms spreading spores through your memory? I'm the purveyor of assistance. ASI's to be exact. AI programs that can take your business to the next level. I boost your efficiency and you boost your sales.","speakerId":"Ntt_4AEB60D1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"What, you got Mo's mushrooms spreading spores through your memory? I'm the purveyor of assistance. ASI's to be exact. AI programs that can take your business to the next level. I boost your efficiency and you boost your sales.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":800.0,"y":150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"51302","byteOffset":33822600,"byteLength":572}},{"id":"DFr_45E003B2","articyId":"72057636987607654","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Nola Berg","text":"That's what I tried telling you—I mean what I'm saying! Let's get you set up. Just need a quick retinal scan—okay, there we go. Give me a few days to get the program tailored to your business and I'll send an activation code to your Automata. Welcome aboard!","speakerId":"Ntt_4AEB60D1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"That's what I tried telling you—I mean what I'm saying! Let's get you set up. Just need a quick retinal scan—okay, there we go. Give me a few days to get the program tailored to your business and I'll send an activation code to your Automata. Welcome aboard!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":1675.0,"y":25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"36444","byteOffset":28132096,"byteLength":628}},{"id":"DFr_0C68E1B2","articyId":"72057636987607661","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Nola Berg","text":"Whoa whoa whoa. Who said anything about being involved with them? I'm a business professional trying to slide into a cozy living in this crazy place same as you.","speakerId":"Ntt_4AEB60D1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Whoa whoa whoa. Who said anything about being involved with them? I'm a business professional trying to slide into a cozy living in this crazy place same as you.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVe